Discriminating experiment: DUCT vs pre-DUCT max-max, head-to-head self-play.
docs/plans/platform-corrections.md C75; docs/plans/sim-search-remedy.md §1.
games=200 per (game,budget,seed) cell; 2 seeds; mirrorSeats=true (default).
Report is W/D/L — never a bare win rate (these games draw heavily).

